"Please log in (using, e.g., \"su\") as the (unprivileged) user that will own "
"the server process."
msgstr "请以将拥有服务器进程的非特权用户身份登录（例如使用 \"su\"）。"

#: initdb.c:631
#, c-format
msgid "\"%s\" is not a valid server encoding name"
msgstr "\"%s\" 不是有效的服务器编码名称"

#: initdb.c:775
#, c-format
msgid "file \"%s\" does not exist"
msgstr "文件 \"%s\" 不存在"

#: initdb.c:776 initdb.c:781 initdb.c:788
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This might mean you have a corrupted installation or identified the wrong "
"directory with the invocation option -L."
msgstr "这可能表示安装已损坏，或调用时通过 -L 选项指定了错误的目录。"

#: initdb.c:780
#, c-format
msgid "could not access file \"%s\": %m"
msgstr "无法访问文件 \"%s\": %m"

#: initdb.c:787
#, c-format
msgid "file \"%s\" is not a regular file"
msgstr "文件 \"%s\" 不是常规文件"

#: initdb.c:922
#, c-format
msgid "selecting dynamic shared memory implementation ... "
msgstr "正在选择动态共享内存实现 ... "

#: initdb.c:931
#, c-format
